# CLAUDE.md

## Commands
- Run the CLI: `python3 src/gradebook.py [add NAME | score NAME VALUE | remove NAME | report]`
- Run tests: `python3 tests/test_gradebook.py`

## Rules
- **Every function that writes grades.json must call `audit(name, action)` from `src/audit.py` right after `save(data)`.** No exceptions.
- New subcommands: a top-level function plus an entry in the dispatch dict at the bottom of `src/gradebook.py`.
- Tests: `unittest` only, in `tests/test_gradebook.py`, same tempfile pattern as `test_average`.

## Architecture
Single-module CLI; each command re-reads and re-writes `grades.json`. No in-memory state.
